# 0008: Feature map columns added and removed

- **Date:** 2026-10-03
- **Status:** Proposed
- **Owners:** #1 Turning raw PR and commit data into model inputs,
Feature engineering

## Context

The extractor's output columns have changed since the feature map in `riffle-data-research.pdf` was written.

## Decision

**Added**

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `label_ci_fail_optional` | An auxiliary check (CodeQL, Scorecards, coverage) failed on the merge commit. Diagnostic only |
| `label_szz_bug` | The PR introduced a line that a later fix commit repaired (SZZ, with `--szz`) |
| `days_to_revert` | Days from merge to the first revert of the PR; null if none within 90 days |
| `days_to_hotfix` | Days from merge to the first hotfix touching the same files; null if none within 90 days |
| `days_to_szz_fix` | Days from merge to the earliest later fix of a line the PR introduced; null if none |
| `merge_via` | How the PR was merged: `github` or `landed_commit` |
| `mined_at` | UTC time the row was extracted |

**Removed**

| Column | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `label_mature` | Whether enough time had passed for the outcome to be known. Now computed at training time from `mined_at - merged_at` |

## Options not taken

| Option | Why not |
| --- | --- |
| Keep `label_mature` | Fixes one maturity threshold into the data |

## Consequences

- Output grows from 153 to 157 columns.
- None of the added columns are model inputs.

## Revisit if

- The contract allows outcome windows above 90 days.
